uvs|n|A hollow metallic vessel, usually shaped somewhat like a cup with a flaring mouth, containing a clapper or tongue, and giving forth a ringing sound on being struck. ; A hollow perforated sphere of metal containing a loose ball which causes it to sound when moved. ; Anything in the form of a bell, as the cup or corol of a flower. ; That part of the capital of a column included between the abacus and neck molding; also used for the naked core of nearly cylindrical shape, assumed to exist within the leafage of a capital. ; The strikes of the bell which mark the time; or the time so designated.	a:2l1n,121,6;34ke,87,6;7se,79,4;4xkz,79,9;n1d,78,56;8w1n,77,4;4ty5,76,2;3w8s,76,4;9w9q,68,13;23h4,68,2;73s0,66,3;2x1s,66,47;9b6s,66,1;8lux,63,5;1put,63,44~6x62,48,411;3l01,60,161;3uj8,42,146;1pve,26,134;adks,32,130;7t8z,28,110;6lfq,10,72;4eus,50,65;9hzm,25,65;6q1o,5,62;8s1h,6,59;n1d,78,56;6pq2,41,54;6bni,12,52;6eqb,9,51	v:9f7j,106,3;28mu,104,9;asws,103,1;9q0p,98,4;aotc,87,2;9dhr,82,18;6txv,82,5;2x1s,79,117;7se,79,4;3wzl,76,5;2jie,75,52;2a12,74,7;8v4i,72,3;4xkz,67,4;3n19,66,1~6pjo,52,176;2x1s,79,117;1883,3,69;2jie,75,52;ad22,50,37;6srp,42,29;4lyc,48,29;3lvx,37,26;agcx,10,24;8ply,55,23;8qo1,63,21;9dhr,82,18;ad25,46,16;82m5,53,11;83ea,35,10	V:2qij,157,119;162m,126,8;9ock,116,2;1jhj,115,3;9q0c,108,4;9q0s,107,38;9q0p,101,5;8wd3,101,1;9gkj,93,7;8kzk,90,363;52vx,87,178;82m5,87,113;52uk,78,11;10pj,77,49;3kly,76,2~8kzk,90,363;52vx,87,178;2qij,157,119;82m5,87,113;2251,30,76;8vpc,14,52;8n54,35,51;10pj,77,49;9iwo,19,46;82lb,23,43;225r,36,41;3sf5,7,39;9q0s,107,38;an9y,12,35;91ol,10,33	n:asws,139,12;6txv,133,169;4ty5,125,60;92ez,121,32;2a29,120,4;9dhr,114,164;8v4i,112,49;1vgi,110,4;eqj,106,2;4xkz,106,58;4tbs,103,27;5gct,100,45;aotc,97,4;8lux,95,46;1kzc,94,6~2ljt,69,467;8lp,77,286;4u4t,49,241;3ts9,93,171;6txv,133,169;9dhr,114,164;2whs,32,109;7t8z,26,92;33vx,47,88;9hai,65,86;1ick,50,83;k8f,46,82;90mt,9,68;ak35,63,62;4ty5,125,60	N:162m,141,23;8wd3,139,14;4cnt,130,15;2qij,124,12;82lz,121,15;